  "generated": "---\ntitle: \"Block phone numbers\"\nslug: \"/apps/ios-blocklist--lchl96vtphrmdtytkicr7qo8\"\nmdx: {\"format\":\"md\"}\ntags: [\"iOS\",\"General\",\"blocklist\",\"ios\",\"working-with-contacts\"]\n---\n\n*Looking for an&#x20;*[Android](/docs/apps/android-blocklist--lg90ce3ygm72r214logejh7k) *or&#x20;*[PC/Mac](/docs/apps/desktop-blocklist--a279g7muy8kgbywr1ja8zwdo) *version of this article?*\n\nYou can block incoming calls and SMS from the selected contacts and phone numbers.\n\n**NOTE:**&#x42;locked contacts are shared across your entire organisation, so if you block a number, it will also appear on other users' blocked list.\n\n## How to block a new contact\n\nTo block a new number:\n\n1. Navigate to Menu > Blocked.\n2. Tap the \"+\" (plus) button.\n3. In the appeared pop-up, specify the phone number and (optionally) the reason for blocking this number.\n4. Press the Block button to confirm.\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/6846927446b7c10ae10b/fe94b54796a0a1c1c68c7391480a786adac5293013c69053be04fead18bac9da.png)\n\n## How to block an existing contact\n\nTo block an existing contact:\n\n1. Navigate to Contacts tab.\n2. Find and select the contact in the list.\n3. In the contact profile, scroll down and press the \"Block\" button.\n4. In the appeared pop-up, (optionally) specify the reason for blocking this number.\n5. Press the Block button to confirm.\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/ca3bb29fb1b1900e1668/8599b27f6e174eb810ac14adf9fdd8337450362a9d4adb3c2bd69a252019016a.png)\n\n## How to unblock a contact\n\nTo unblock a blocked contact:\n\n1. Navigate to Menu > Blocked.\n2. Find and select the contact in the list.\n3. In the blocked contact profile, scroll down and press the \"Unblock\" button.\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/7be927d9d3c7523298f1/4abbd4cef10172163682b5a9c3a78c1bd4c670bd14f78edea3553113fd149085.png)\n\n## Related articles\n\n- [Block phone numbers](/docs/apps/desktop-blocklist--a279g7muy8kgbywr1ja8zwdo)\n- [Create a new contact](/docs/apps/ios-create-a-new-contact--oq34jldzp7zc312g712bn73x)\n- [Working with contacts](/docs/apps/ios-working-with-contacts--fkd2qyccst8qw7mnpdkeyppp)\n"
